## Task
Implement the enhancement: **Expose the GEOS WKTReader “fix_structure” option in Shapely’s WKT reader**, so that invalid-but-repairable structures like **unclosed polygon rings** can be loaded when requested.

### Key requirement (do not deviate)
- **Do NOT implement a custom WKT parser/rewriter in Python.**
- The issue title is explicit: *“expose fix_structure keyword in WKT reader”*. This implies GEOS already provides this functionality and Shapely must wire it through the C-extension/ufunc layer.
